      <cyrillic>алгуурлах</cyrillic>
      <transcript>ALГURLA-</transcript>
      <definition>v.t. and 1. Todo or act slowly or quietly; to dawdle; to delay, put off, procrastinate.</definition>
      <page>31</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠠᠯᠭᠤᠷᠯᠠᠨ ᠰᠠᠭᠠᠲᠠᠭᠤᠯᠬᠤ</unicode>
